		"name": "Sadiid Offline POS API",
		"description": "# 🏪 Sadiid Offline POS API Collection\n\nThis collection contains all API endpoints used by the Sadiid Offline POS application for testing and development.\n\n## 🚀 Getting Started\n\n### Authentication\nAll endpoints require OAuth 2.0 Bearer token authentication. Start by using the Login endpoint to get your access token.\n\n### Base URL\n```\nhttps://erp.sadiid.net/connector/api\n```\n\n### Environment Variables\nSet up these variables in your Postman environment:\n- `baseUrl`: https://erp.sadiid.net/connector/api\n- `authUrl`: https://erp.sadiid.net/oauth/token\n- `accessToken`: (will be set automatically after login)\n- `username`: your_username\n- `password`: your_password\n- `clientId`: your_client_id\n- `clientSecret`: your_client_secret\n\n## 📝 API Features\n\n- **Authentication**: OAuth 2.0 with token refresh\n- **Business Management**: Get business details and locations\n- **Product Management**: CRUD operations for products and categories\n- **Customer Management**: Full customer lifecycle management\n- **Sales Processing**: Create, read, update sales transactions\n- **Attendance Tracking**: Clock in/out functionality\n\n## 🔧 Error Handling\n\nThe API returns standard HTTP status codes:\n- 200: Success\n- 201: Created\n- 400: Bad Request\n- 401: Unauthorized\n- 403: Forbidden\n- 404: Not Found\n- 422: Validation Error\n- 429: Rate Limited\n- 500: Server Error\n\n## 📊 Rate Limits\n\n- Authentication: 5 requests/minute\n- Standard endpoints: 60 requests/minute\n- Heavy operations: 10 requests/minute",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"_exporter_id": "sadiid-pos-team"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Authentication",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Login",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.environment.set('accessToken', jsonData.access_token);",
									"    pm.environment.set('refreshToken', jsonData.refresh_token);",
									"    pm.test('Login successful', function () {",
									"        pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
									"        pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('access_token');",
									"    });",
									"} else {",
									"    pm.test('Login failed', function () {",
									"        pm.response.to.have.status(401);",
									"    });",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "urlencoded",
							"urlencoded": [
								{
									"key": "grant_type",
									"value": "password",
									"type": "text"
								},
								{
									"key": "client_id",
									"value": "{{clientId}}",
									"type": "text"
								},
								{
									"key": "client_secret",
									"value": "{{clientSecret}}",
									"type": "text"
								},
								{
									"key": "username",
									"value": "{{username}}",
									"type": "text"
								},
								{
									"key": "password",
									"value": "{{password}}",
									"type": "text"
								},
								{
									"key": "scope",
									"value": "*",
									"type": "text"
								}
							]
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{authUrl}}",
							"host": [
								"{{authUrl}}"
							]
						},
						"description": "Authenticate user and get access token for API requests.\n\n**Required Parameters:**\n- grant_type: password\n- client_id: Your OAuth client ID\n- client_secret: Your OAuth client secret\n- username: User's username or email\n- password: User's password\n- scope: * (full access)\n\n**Response:**\n- access_token: Bearer token for API requests\n- refresh_token: Token for refreshing access\n- expires_in: Token expiration time in seconds"
					},
					"response": [
						{
							"name": "Success",
							"originalRequest": {
								"method": "POST",
								"header": [],
								"body": {
									"mode": "urlencoded",
									"urlencoded": [
										{
											"key": "grant_type",
											"value": "password"
										}
									]
								},
								"url": {
									"raw": "{{authUrl}}"
								}
							},
							"status": "OK",
							"code": 200,
							"_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
							"header": [],
							"cookie": [],
							"body": "{\n  \"access_token\": \"eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiJ9...\",\n  \"token_type\": \"Bearer\",\n  \"expires_in\": 31536000,\n  \"refresh_token\": \"def50200...\"\n}"
						}
					]
				}
			],
			"description": "Authentication endpoints for OAuth 2.0 token management."
		},
